       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْحَةٌ مِنَ الظِّبَآءِ</span> <i>Flesh-meat of gazelles cut in the manner termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْح</span>
